      "statement": "The Scheduler exposes three registration methods: every() for elapsed UTC time (min 60s), calendarAt() for local wall-clock time with an explicit IANA timezone (hourly/daily/weekly), and runAt() for once at an absolute timestamp or timezone-aware wall-clock time; callbacks must be made persistent with ctx.restore() before registration.",
